<p>Salaami har taraf shore buka hai<br />
vidaae hazrate mushkilkusha hai</p>

<p>tazazzul masjide koofa me hai aaj<br />
sutoone kaaba e eemaa'n gira hai</p>

<p>Ali ibne abitaalib mera sher<br />
abhi talwaar se zaqmi hua hai</p>

<p>kisi ne juz ali qaatil ko apne<br />
dame iftaar bhi sharbat diya hai</p>

<p>Ali aisa saqi tha waa dareghaa<br />
gala shabbir ka pyaasa kata hai</p>

<p>pakad kar ibne muljim ko jo laaye<br />
kaha as'haab ne ab hukm kya hai</p>

<p>bashafaqat poocha qaatil se Ali ne<br />
qata meri hai ya teri qata hai</p>

<p>kiya bin baap ka bacho'n ko mere<br />
yahi ehsaan ka mere sila hai<br />
</p>